WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.880
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain a Russian sports comedy film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:16.320
called “I Am Losing Weight”. Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:22.640
The movie begins in the city of Nizhny Novgorod,&nbsp;
Russia. Anya is a girl in her twenties living&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:28.720
with her bodybuilder and swimming coach boyfriend&nbsp;
Zhenya. She works in a bakery and hence is always&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:34.080
working with food. When the couple first met, she&nbsp;
was a size zero but over the months she has gained&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:38.960
a considerable amount of weight. One day, they&nbsp;
are called to a friend’s wedding. Anya tries on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:44.080
clothes from a few months ago and realizes that&nbsp;
they do not fit anymore. She consoles herself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:49.760
by saying that no one will notice but the change&nbsp;
in her body is significant. Zhenya knows this too&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:53.520
but he doesn’t want to comment on how much&nbsp;
weight she has gained, knowing that it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:58.720
a sensitive topic for her. After trying on a&nbsp;
few clothes and ripping some in the process,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:03.600
Anya finds a decent one and gets ready. 
When Zhenya gets a look at her in the dress,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:09.840
his face drops in shock, she is no longer the girl&nbsp;
he was in a relationship with. He doesn’t want to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:14.240
be seen with her at the wedding because all his&nbsp;
friends from the fitness industry will be there.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:18.320
He gives her subtle hints, hoping that&nbsp;
she will stay home. To his relief,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:23.840
Anya says that she wants to stay home and order&nbsp;
pizza. She urges him to stay with her but Zhenya&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:29.440
promises to congratulate the newlyweds and return&nbsp;
home in an instant. Before leaving, he picks her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:34.320
up and puts her on the counter but dodges&nbsp;
when she tries to kiss him. Anya notices the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:39.200
gesture but hides the fact that she is hurt. 
After he leaves, she changes into comfortable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:44.240
clothes and weighs herself to find out she&nbsp;
is seventy-six kilos. Although she is always&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:48.720
complaining about gaining weight, her only&nbsp;
resolution is to drink a glass of water after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:53.920
saying her daily affirmations. Even now, she cooks&nbsp;
some fried food and scrolls through the internet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:58.800
while waiting for her boyfriend. While she is on&nbsp;
the phone, she notices pictures of Zhenya and his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:03.680
friends at the wedding. She zooms into a group&nbsp;
picture and is troubled to see that the girls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:09.440
Zhenya hangs out with are skinny and fit. She&nbsp;
cannot help but compare herself to them. Then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:15.120
she comes across a picture of Zhenya and a girl.&nbsp;
On checking her profile she is horrified to see a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:19.920
boomerang of the girl kissing him on the cheek.&nbsp;
The video is enough for Anya to get dressed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:25.200
put on some makeup, and rush to the wedding. 
She calls her best friend Natasha to pick her up.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:30.720
Natasha also notices that she has gained weight&nbsp;
but to her, Anya still looks just as beautiful.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:35.680
She holds her face, telling her to be confident&nbsp;
about her body. When Anya reaches the venue,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:40.960
she sees Zhenya dancing with the girl and getting&nbsp;
a bit too close. Jealousy makes the best of her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:46.160
and she gets in between them. Zhenya is visibly&nbsp;
surprised but he continues dancing as the other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:51.680
girl scoffs and walks away. A while later, the&nbsp;
couple takes a seat and Anya starts eating.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:56.400
She asks him why he was dancing with a girl but&nbsp;
Zhenya tries to pass it off by saying they were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:01.760
dancing in a group. When Anya pushes him, he&nbsp;
lashes out and admits that he doesn’t like her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:07.520
anymore. He adds that she does nothing but eat and&nbsp;
has turned into a burden for him. Anya gets teary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:13.040
but before they can talk, the newlywed couple&nbsp;
approaches them. They try to smile but it vanishes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:18.640
when the bride asks Anya if she is pregnant.
Following that, Zhenya wishes her farewell and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:23.600
walks away. In the next scene, Anya is on a bus&nbsp;
on her way to her mother’s house. She is crying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:29.440
uncontrollably, not caring what people think fo&nbsp;
her. She walks into her mother talking to a date.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:34.480
He notices something is off and walks outside to&nbsp;
give them privacy. Anya tells her mother that her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:39.520
boyfriend broke up with her because of her weight.&nbsp;
Her mother comments that she is not fat, she just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:45.360
has wide bones that she cannot control. The remark&nbsp;
makes her feel a lot worse than she already did.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:50.160
At night, she sleeps on her mother’s couch while&nbsp;
going through Zhenya’s pictures on her phone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:55.200
She also comes across a picture of herself from&nbsp;
a few months ago. She zooms into her body and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:59.760
is saddened to see how much she has changed.
The next morning, she gets a call from Natasha&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:04.800
who asks her to come over. Anya takes a bed on&nbsp;
Natasha’s balcony and stays there complaining&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:09.760
about the breakup. It turns out that Zhenya&nbsp;
had come there last evening to drop off all her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:15.440
belongings. Natasha asks her to stay with her and&nbsp;
her husband Dimas for a few days until she finds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:20.640
her own place. She tries to comfort her friend but&nbsp;
Anya doesn’t want to feel better, she only wants&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:26.080
to cry and complain about her lousy ex-boyfriend&nbsp;
who she wants to get back together with. 
&nbsp;

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:31.120
Even Dimas tries to make her feel better, claiming&nbsp;
that she is the sexiest girl in the town but it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:35.600
does nothing to help Anya. She spends the night&nbsp;
on the balcony and is approached by Natasha the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:40.800
next morning. Natasha tells her the story about a&nbsp;
friend who was in the same position as Anya. Her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:45.440
boyfriend broke up with her over text because she&nbsp;
had gained weight. Instead of bitching and moaning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:50.800
like Anya, the girl went to the gym and got slim&nbsp;
in only a month. The poor boyfriend regretted his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:55.440
decision so much that he filled her office with&nbsp;
flowers to ask her to get back with him. 
&nbsp;

00:04:55.440 --> 00:05:00.320
When Anya complains that she doesn’t have enough&nbsp;
money to join a gym, Natasha suggests she use the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:05.920
one-week free trial in all gyms in the town and&nbsp;
do it for free. The next morning, Anya says her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:11.440
morning affirmations, drinks a glass of water, and&nbsp;
goes to the gym for the first time in her life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:15.200
She takes a while to get accustomed to the&nbsp;
equipment and falls off the treadmill on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:19.920
several occasions. But all her hard work goes&nbsp;
to waste because an hour later, she is at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:25.360
restaurant eating for two. Natasha, who works in&nbsp;
the restaurant throws her food away, disappointed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:30.080
that she couldn’t commit for more than two hours.&nbsp;
She asks her friend to show some willpower.
&nbsp;

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:33.760
On returning home, Anya applies&nbsp;
moisturizer all over her body&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:38.000
and wraps it with a plastic wrap. She hopes&nbsp;
that the trick will make her lose a few pounds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:42.880
while devouring a bag of chips. At midnight,&nbsp;
she tries to steal food from the refrigerator&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:48.080
but is caught by Natasha. The next day, she&nbsp;
is determined to not eat anything unhealthy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:52.880
This is especially difficult for her because she&nbsp;
works in a bakery. While decorating a cake, she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:58.480
accidentally licks icing off her fighters and does&nbsp;
ten squats to make up for it. Throughout the day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:04.320
food calls her name but she controls herself. At&nbsp;
one point, she is left alone with an entire cake.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:09.120
She stares at it for several minutes trying&nbsp;
to make up an excuse to eat it. After pacing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:14.800
around and almost breaking a shelf, she gives&nbsp;
up and devours half of the cake at once.
&nbsp;

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:19.280
Anya realizes that she has a problem. She&nbsp;
looks for a self help group for people with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:24.240
compulsive eating disorder and joins a meeting.&nbsp;
Amidst the group of ladies is a single man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:29.840
named Kolya. Anya introduces herself as Angela&nbsp;
and lies that she doesn’t have an eating disorder.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:34.080
Instead, she claims to be a journalist who&nbsp;
is writing a story on eating disorders.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:38.560
The group tries to reason with their condition,&nbsp;
not accepting the fact that they have a problem.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:44.160
An infuriated Kolya points at each of them&nbsp;
and calls them fat, including himself. He also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:49.360
says that it is obvious Anya lied about being a&nbsp;
journalist because she doesn’t want to accept she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:54.720
has a problem. Anya pretends to get a phone call&nbsp;
and leaves the meeting but Kolya follows her.
&nbsp;

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:59.440
He invites her to a nearby restaurant and Anya&nbsp;
goes only because she cannot say no to food.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:04.400
Kolya proposes they become each other's fitness&nbsp;
sponsors. That way they have to exercise with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:09.040
each other daily, ask each other before eating&nbsp;
anything and provide emotional support throughout&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:14.560
the process. Anya is unsure about Kolya’s true&nbsp;
intentions but she sees no harm in trying. 
&nbsp;

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:20.320
Starting the next day, they go to a park every&nbsp;
morning to run. At first, Anya is reluctant to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:25.760
with Kolya but as time passes, she realizes that&nbsp;
he is actually a nice person. He is not ashamed of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:31.040
what his body looks like which is foreign to her.&nbsp;
Spending time with him makes her love her body as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:35.360
well. They talk before every meal and are good at&nbsp;
helping each other since they are going through&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:40.880
the same problem. Soon, Anya starts to lose weight&nbsp;
little by little. Her confidence wavers when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:46.240
she goes to pool parties and sees skinny girls&nbsp;
looking gorgeous. Whenever she feels frustrated,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:51.680
Kolya helps her. They frequently scream on top of&nbsp;
their lungs to relieve stress. Anya wants nothing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:58.160
but Zhenya’s validation which makes Kolya jealous.&nbsp;
In one and a half months, she drops down ten kilos&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:02.720
and is ready to meet Zhenya again.
She buys a swimsuit and pretends to bump into him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:07.680
at a swimming pool. He works as an instructor and&nbsp;
is stunned to see her. After chatting for a while,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:12.000
they get into the pool and start splashing&nbsp;
water at each other. Everything goes well&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:16.480
until the girl from the wedding arrives and&nbsp;
introduces herself as Zhenya’s girlfriend.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:21.840
Anya is heartbroken for the second time. She&nbsp;
parties and drinks all night to forget about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:27.440
him. The following morning, she wakes up naked in&nbsp;
Kolya’s bed. He assures her that he did not look&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:32.000
at her naked. A flashback from the other night&nbsp;
shows us that Anya was about to go home with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:37.280
stranger but Kolya arrived at the right time&nbsp;
and took a punch in the face to save her. 
&nbsp;

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:42.000
Following the strange morning, she goes to her&nbsp;
mother’s house and tells her everything. According&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:47.680
to her mother, Anya has unresolved trauma from&nbsp;
her father who left them when she was only a kid.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:52.880
Hence, she wants Zhenya’s validation even though&nbsp;
he is not good to her. Anya understands what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:57.840
she means and goes to meet her father the very&nbsp;
next day. She takes Kolya as her driver because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:03.440
the drive is five hours long. On their way, Kolya&nbsp;
often tries to get closer to her, showing that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:09.200
likes her but Anya is oblivious to his advances.&nbsp;
They finally meet her father Sergey in a wooden&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:14.240
house where he lives with a woman. Anya asks him&nbsp;
why he didn’t want to be involved in her life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:18.720
Sergey, on the other hand, reminds her of the time&nbsp;
he came to her birthday with a present but she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:24.240
flipped him off through the window. At night, Anya&nbsp;
accidentally drops a candle and lights the wooden&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:29.680
house on fire. Sergey yells at her for ruining&nbsp;
his house, not caring about her safety. 
&nbsp;

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:34.640
Anya and Kolya return home immediately&nbsp;
after. Before separating, she kisses him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:39.840
on the nose. Kolya is on the top of the world&nbsp;
on his ride home. He even trades his watch to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:45.600
buy flowers for her. Somewhere else, Zhenya&nbsp;
comes to meet Anya and apologizes to her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:50.480
They end up making love after talking for a&nbsp;
while. When Kolya returns with the flowers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:55.840
he sees them and walks away disappointed.
The next morning, Anya wakes up with Zhenya who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.840 --> 00:10:00.640
comments that she looks so much better than she&nbsp;
did a month ago. This makes Anya realize that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:05.440
doesn’t want an uncertain relationship where she&nbsp;
is always scared her partner will leave her. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:11.440
get into an argument yet again and Zhenya walks&nbsp;
away. That evening, she goes to Kolya’s house,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:15.920
wanting to be with a friend. But Kolya&nbsp;
is so furious that he gives her an apple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:20.560
and declares that their relationship as sponsors&nbsp;
has ended now that she has lost weight. 
&nbsp;

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:25.200
The next morning, she goes to Natasha’s house but&nbsp;
no one opens the door. She uses the neighbor’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:30.240
window and a pipeline to dangerously get inside&nbsp;
the house. It turns out that Natasha and her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:35.120
husband had a huge argument after which he&nbsp;
left. The girls talk to each other and feel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:41.280
a lot better. The next day, Sergey comes to meet&nbsp;
Anya again and apologizes for being a bad father.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:46.640
He also dances with her like he used to do when&nbsp;
she was a kid. After the two reconcile, Anya goes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:51.680
to a fitness marathon to meet Kolya. She finds&nbsp;
him drinking a cold drink and throws it away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:56.880
asserting her dominance as his sponsor. She also&nbsp;
declares that since he has not lost enough weight,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:01.840
it is her responsibility to help him no matter&nbsp;
what. They take part in the marathon and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:06.800
complete it with all their might. In the end,&nbsp;
Kolya gathers enough courage to kiss her. 
&nbsp;

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:11.120
For the first time in her life Anya&nbsp;
realizes that obsessing about her appearance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:15.600
will not make her happy. True happiness&nbsp;
lies in accepting yourself as you are,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:20.400
like Kolya did. He always worked hard to&nbsp;
improve his health but was never ashamed of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:24.800
appearance. Anya strives to be like him. 
